  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It moves around its area looking for nearby targets and attacks with jumps, lunges, and bites. It remains aggressive, but its low threat level rarely forces the player to stop completely.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is hostile, although in Grounded 2 it is a much smaller threat than in the original game. It can be killed very easily and may even die in a single hit if you ram it with your Buggy.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It can become involved in fights with nearby creatures. On its own it is rarely a problem, but it can be annoying if it appears while you are already fighting more dangerous enemies.",
  "strategy": "It normally requires no special strategy. Ignore it if it is not in your way, or kill it quickly with Spicy damage. If you are riding a Buggy, simply ramming it is often enough. Its real danger appears when it joins a fight already in progress.",
